    "collapsible_content_BTNAaz": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "content_DkJCN7": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Where are you located?",
            "content": "<p>Free Spirited is proudly based in sunny Sunrise, Florida! We ship all our tie-dye shirt orders directly from here! 🇺🇸</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_hGyciK": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are all of your shirts really made by hand?",
            "content": "<p>Yes! Every single shirt is dyed by hand, then pre-washed and pre-shrunk before it ships. Want to see for yourself? Check out <a href=\"/pages/how-we-make-your-shirt\" title=\"How we make your shirt\">how we make your shirt.</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "content_zB7xPz": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will I get a tracking number for my order?",
            "content": "<p>Of course! As soon as your order ships, you’ll get a tracking email so you can follow your package’s magical journey to your doorstep.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_N3HAa6": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What size would fit me best?",
            "content": "<p>We get it—sizing can be tricky! That’s why we include a handy size chart on every product page. Still unsure? Reach out to us using the “Contact Us” form or email us at <a><strong>support@shopfreespirited.com</strong></a>. We’re here to help! Fun fact: 98.4% of our customers say our shirts fit true to size. 💫</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_JJDzzM": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are your shirts made from?",
            "content": "<p>Our shirts are crafted from premium fabrics that feel amazing to wear:</p><ul><li><strong>Tees and Tank Tops</strong>: 100% pre-shrunk, softer-than-soft cotton.</li><li><strong>V-Necks</strong>: A comfy blend of 60% ring-spun cotton and 40% polyester.</li><li><strong>Long Sleeves</strong>: Made from durable, pre-shrunk 100% heavyweight cotton.</li></ul><p>That’s why they’re not just soft—they’re <em>softer-than-soft!</em> 🌈</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_rbQYYK": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you offer plus sizes?",
            "content": "<p>Yes! We proudly offer sizes from S to 5XL, so everyone can join the tie-dye fun. We offer every style in at least a 3XL, and you can check out our 4XL and 5XL designs <a href=\"https://shopfreespirited.com/collections/shop-sale?filter.v.price.gte=&filter.v.price.lte=&filter.v.option.size=4XL&filter.v.option.size=5XL&sort_by=manual\" title=\"https://shopfreespirited.com/collections/shop-sale?filter.v.price.gte=&filter.v.price.lte=&filter.v.option.size=4XL&filter.v.option.size=5XL&sort_by=manual\">here</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_fUXj3w": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What if I need to return my shirts?",
            "content": "<p>No worries—we’ve got a problem-free philosophy! If you’re not totally in love with your purchase, you can return it for a full refund within 30 days. Just make sure it’s unworn and unwashed, and we’ll handle the rest.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_wRNY9t": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why are these shirts discounted so much?",
            "content": "<p>Choose Insider Pricing for our lowest price and a <strong>21-day Free Spirited Insiders Club trial</strong>. After the trial, recurring Club membership renews at <strong>$24.95/month plus applicable taxes unless canceled</strong>. Prefer a standard one-time purchase? Choose Full Price in the cart drawer. You can <a href=\"https://insiders.shopfreespirited.com/login?action=CANCEL\" title=\"https://insiders.shopfreespirited.com/login?action=CANCEL\">cancel anytime here.</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "content_NrE6rf": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are you closing your entire store?",
            "content": "<p><strong>No, we’re not closing our store!</strong> We run collection closing sales to make room for new designs. Some of our current styles will be <strong>retired</strong>, while others may return in our upcoming collections.</p><p>If you see a design you love, we recommend grabbing it before it’s gone—prices and availability may change in future collections!</p>"
          }
        }
      },
